nts","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Nightlife","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Q_Wo3rX84Dy-YdQsiDmrWw","review_id":"jGnmPkTmBgZ8EwcQ3yW8Zg","date":"2011-07-26T15:54:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9422840476036072,"text_excerpt":"I was really impressed with Chickie Wah Wah. I went for a UYE to grab some Taceaux Loceaux from the kitchen and enjoy some bluegrass. I've reviewed the taceauxs before (DELICIOUS) but didn't talk much about the venue itself. It's nice to have a non-smoking venue and the two times I've been there the live music was pretty good if not something I typically listen to. I'd spend more time there but I prefer to hear my companions when we're talking, which isn't always possible since there's a live band playing. The bartender was nice and they have a good selection of drinks. It's really the Taceaux Loceaux that will keep me coming back, but for a bar it's really nice. PS, it's worth noting tha..."},{"business_id":"Q_Wo3rX84Dy-YdQsiDmrWw","review_id":"RCrLcvfym8khqpiLonPGhQ","date":"2016-04-26T19:35:33","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.936343789100647,"text_excerpt":"I found this place on a google search while planning my 5 days in New Orleans and what a great find it was. I wanted to catch some live music in the afternoon before we took a break before dinner and Chickie Wah Wah did not disappoint. The performer that day was't really my style but extremely talented none the less. I had a gin martini and the bartend made it perfect. The drinks are cheap and the BBQ was hearty (I had to try some, even though I was headed to dinner in a bit). Our group really enjoyed this place, some of us smoked on the patio with their drinks while the live music was on speaker out there. Some of us sat at the bar and some of us sat at the stage and watch the live music..."},{"business_id":"Q_Wo3rX84Dy-YdQsiDmrWw","review_id":"bJacOEjiUwVxEDXKi4ZiUQ","date":"2014-12-22T01:34:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9331240653991699,"text_excerpt":"This is my favorite music bar in town. It has loads of character. Great beer selection (I suggest asking the bartender for a recommendation). The kitchen serves excellent BBQ. I have seen people get turned off on this place because of the cover charge, but it's how the musicians get paid, so I have no complaints."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Q_Wo3rX84Dy-YdQsiDmrWw","photo_id":"SqMYo_49PFKOLdpYDHJ53w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/SqMYo_49PFKOLdpYDHJ53w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9348931312561035},{"business_id":"Q_Wo3rX84Dy-YdQsiDmrWw","photo_id":"mLuHogYmni5hZgK6Z_Au4w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/mLuHogYmni5hZgK6Z_Au4w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9161756634712219},{"business_id":"Q_Wo3rX84Dy-YdQsiDmrWw","photo_id":"BbRxEhVAvUejhe_PvveAeg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos